WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.362
Stage 2 is production,
with the same commands.

2
00:00:03.362 --> 00:00:07.612
Write production's settings file,
pointing it at the test stage's evidence.

3
00:00:07.612 --> 00:00:12.537
Run the preflight live: its seventh check
fails unless that test evidence passes.

4
00:00:12.537 --> 00:00:14.286
In the change window, plan,

5
00:00:14.286 --> 00:00:18.449
have the reviewers approve the
hash, and apply only that plan.

6
00:00:18.449 --> 00:00:23.555
Schedule the weekly run under the reader
identity in the agency's own scheduler; the

7
00:00:23.555 --> 00:00:28.512
first production run is the baseline, and
every run after carries its comparison.

8
00:00:28.512 --> 00:00:32.515
Production's own evidence check
adds the plan and the comparison,

9
00:00:32.515 --> 00:00:34.887
so it passes from the second weekly run.

10
00:00:34.887 --> 00:00:37.561
Switching the initiative to enforcing,

11
00:00:37.561 --> 00:00:42.890
remediation and exemptions are the guide's
Step 9, each its own reviewed change.
